      "TEXT": "Healing 3 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Huun\u0027reh",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zombie Specter ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zombies Enabled ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord Archon \n\u0022Not long ago we managed to chase off the Undead Hordes! In our haste we neglected to notice that the land had been polluted with dark Hordes magic. Many of the dead are restless and walk among us! We must put an end to this!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur \n\u0022Your words true as they may be do not give us any notion as to how to end this abomination!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord Archon \n\u0022Silence! I have not yet finished! Interrupt me again and you will join the walking undead! There is an item somewhere in this realm! We must find it and bring it to the well. Only then will we cancel out the dark magic that festers!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022The Empire will claim this land. The Undead Hordes have cast a horrible spell causing numerous Zombies to roam the area. We must retrieve a magical item and bring it to a magical well. Only then will we succeed in ending this curse!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage \n\u0022My Lord, there are Elves in the realm. They will surely try to take this land as their own. Despite the fact that the Zombies have already decimated the few Elves that lived here? What are we to do should we come across the Elven Alliance!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022Why do you bother me with questions in which you already know the answer to. The Empire will conquer this realm and should the Elves be foolish enough to cross our path they shall share the same fate as the Undead!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246UN0035",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zythaar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elven Healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Lord Archon  \n\u0022The Undead Hordes managed to steal a scroll of healing from the Empire. In their haste to leave this place they buried the scroll into the cursed ground. Magic from the scroll has created some areas in which we can heal our wounded.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Day 5 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022I have just found out that one of our healing scrolls has been stolen by the Hordes. Our Ranger tracked the thief in time to see him burying the scroll into the cursed ground. The scroll\u0027s magic and the ground caused an explosion.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022After the explosion everything changed. The whole region is decaying right before our eyes. Some good though has come out of this. There are some areas in which all life will be healed. We must find and use these regions!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Death River City ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022I have found some scrolls that mention of a werewolf. This creature has what we are looking for. More disturbing is that the wolf is immune to all weapons! We must plan accordingly\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Allantyr ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022I have found the location of the Soul Dagger. In the North East the dagger is being guarded by a pack of wolves and one other creature. The creature\u0027s identity has been burned away from the scroll!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sorenburg ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Titan \n\u0022Very well you have defeated us! The magic well is being protected by a creature that breathes death. A dragon like creature that hungers for your defeat. Bewarned this creature is not alone!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zombie",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Margylla ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S246SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S246EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We can use this city to rest and heal! The upcoming battle will take a lot out of us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
